## Example 2:
Input:
### Added files:
[__pycache__/main.cpython-310.pyc, dist/app.js, .env.local, .vscode/settings.json]

### Deleted files:
[]

### Modified files:
[]

### current .gitignore Content
*.log

Expected Output:
```
# Compiled and build artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
dist/
build/

# Dependencies
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
```

## Example 3:
Input:
### Added files:
[target/debug/app.exe, node_modules/lodash/index.js, .gitignore]

### Deleted files:
[]

### Modified files:
[package-lock.json]

### current .gitignore Content
node_modules/

Expected Output:
```
# Compiled and build artifacts
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.a
*.obj
*.out
target/

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Environment
.env
.env.*
*.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# Original rules preserved
node_modules/
```

